      "writtenOn": "2025-11-30T20:31:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that we have domain-\u003eagaw, we can use it in the `iommu_set_lm_ce` and  `iommu_set_pasid_sl` hypercalls instead of relying on the host to pass `domain_agaw`? and thus can remove `domain_agaw` from pkvm_lm_context_param and pkvm_sm_context_param? \n\nBTW if the order of patches was different (first these domain hypercalls, and only after that the context/pasid update hypercalls, IOW if the hypercalls were implemented in the order in which the host calls them), we wouldn\u0027t need that `domain_agaw` parameter even temporarily?",
      "revId": "e5e35b1f833d316c8b9272c7e36380622f20c5dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dd4aea39_8f555d7c",
